sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Child
  participant W as Kid Reader
  participant API as KidService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  C->>W: Open story from bookshelf
  W->>API: POST /kid/sessions {storyId}
  API->>DB: on child shelf? loadReadiness (reviewed + all clips ready)
  alt not ready
    API-->>W: 422 Story not ready
  end
  API->>DB: resume in_progress or create play_session (is_first_play if first)
  API-->>W: pages, audio URLs, checkpoints WITHOUT correct answers
  loop each checkpoint
    C->>W: Choose emotion / option
    W->>API: POST /kid/sessions/:id/answers
    API->>DB: first answer? snapshot score, skill, sub-skill, template version
    alt wrong first choice (emotion / perspective)
      API-->>W: hint, ask to choose again
      C->>W: Second choice
      W->>API: POST answers (attempt 2, score unchanged)
    end
    API-->>W: outcome + correct answer audio
  end
  W->>API: POST /kid/sessions/:id/complete (idempotent)
